WEBVTT

00:13.460 --> 00:14.410
An angel?

00:16.340 --> 00:17.320
A demon?

00:23.300 --> 00:24.040
Who's there?

00:25.300 --> 00:26.500
Please...

00:27.000 --> 00:29.640
free me from these chains.

00:33.380 --> 00:37.670
You're asking me, a human, for help?

00:38.990 --> 00:40.180
<i>That can't be.</i>

00:40.690 --> 00:44.520
<i>Alternate races and humans have waged 
a fierce war against each other.</i>

00:45.220 --> 00:47.310
<i>That's the history I know!</i>

00:48.400 --> 00:51.710
That's... how it's supposed to be!

00:52.540 --> 00:56.930
Why doesn't anyone remember the real world?!

01:00.030 --> 01:04.960
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

01:17.180 --> 01:20.340
Kai! Are you done yet?

01:20.340 --> 01:23.630
You know he always monitors
the graveyard for 300 seconds.

01:23.630 --> 01:24.770
Just wait, okay?

01:25.480 --> 01:28.160
There's no way Kai's going to stop 
in the middle of it anyway.

01:28.160 --> 01:29.650
Aw, come on!

01:29.950 --> 01:32.340
Can't we just be done with it?!

01:32.340 --> 01:33.730
We can't do that.

01:42.890 --> 01:45.370
The demons, 
wielders of mighty magical powers.

01:46.580 --> 01:50.860
The celestials, 
demi-humans such as angels and elves.

01:52.030 --> 01:55.510
The spirits, creatures that possess 
special kinds of bodies, such as ghosts.

01:56.810 --> 02:01.630
The mythical beasts, 
colossal fierce beasts such as dragons.

02:03.330 --> 02:05.750
The war between these four races and humanity...

02:06.460 --> 02:10.660
We can't allow another Great War 
of the Five Races to ever occur again.

02:11.940 --> 02:15.690
We, the Urza Federation, have an obligation 
to observe this graveyard

02:15.690 --> 02:18.070
where the demons have been sealed away.

02:19.380 --> 02:20.480
Three hundred seconds.

02:22.140 --> 02:23.490
The graveyard shows no abnormalities.

02:24.610 --> 02:27.190
The demons are properly sealed.

02:29.400 --> 02:31.970
He's always so serious.

02:31.970 --> 02:33.320
So what?

02:33.320 --> 02:36.550
Because of that, you and I 
can take it easy.

02:42.970 --> 02:44.330
Hey, Kai.

02:44.330 --> 02:49.320
Tell me, has a sealed demon ever 
escaped within the past hundred years?

02:49.320 --> 02:50.310
No.

02:50.310 --> 02:54.820
Our job as the Humanity Aegis Agency 
is to make sure that never happens.

02:54.820 --> 02:56.460
That's a fair argument.

02:56.460 --> 02:58.500
Ugh, but you know,

02:58.500 --> 03:01.140
there are four of these 
graveyards around the world.

03:01.140 --> 03:04.490
Isn't it pointless if we're
the only ones serious about it?

03:04.490 --> 03:08.290
Of course the other sites 
are also being taken seriously.

03:08.540 --> 03:11.110
If, by any chance,
 a demon were to get out,

03:11.110 --> 03:12.680
it would be a catastrophe.

03:13.250 --> 03:16.550
Well, yeah, but...

03:16.550 --> 03:18.420
Now, now, Kai.

03:18.420 --> 03:22.260
A demon <i>hasn't</i> gotten out, 
and the world is at peace.

03:22.260 --> 03:23.260
I know.

03:23.800 --> 03:25.550
I just don't want to let my guard down.

03:25.970 --> 03:29.530
Watching over the graveyard is my duty.

03:30.350 --> 03:33.690
<b>Urza Federation
Vishal</b>

03:33.690 --> 03:37.650
<b>Humanity Aegis Agency
Vishal Branch</b>

03:41.680 --> 03:42.360
<i>Warning.</i>

03:42.790 --> 03:45.060
<i>Kai Sakura Vento, low-rank soldier.</i>

03:45.060 --> 03:48.730
<i>It is extremely dangerous to use 
a mythical beast type machine doll</i>

03:48.730 --> 03:50.280
<i>for combat training purposes.</i>

03:59.960 --> 04:00.710
Not good enough?

04:02.550 --> 04:03.850
Watch out!

04:05.020 --> 04:06.770
Stop signal confirmed.

04:06.770 --> 04:09.740
Mythical beast dragon type 
hologram deactivated.

04:10.770 --> 04:14.020
It was warning you so much. 
You're pushing yourself too far.

04:14.020 --> 04:16.180
You're going to get hurt real bad someday.

04:17.130 --> 04:20.200
It'd be pointless training 
if I didn't take the risk.

04:21.700 --> 04:24.360
I bet if you were born during 
the Great War of the Five Races,

04:24.810 --> 04:26.570
your name would've gone down in history.

04:27.140 --> 04:29.440
Just like Prophet Sid?

04:33.610 --> 04:36.710
I'd be honored, but I'm not cut out for that.

04:37.390 --> 04:39.590
Prophet Sid, huh?

04:39.590 --> 04:44.470
I can't imagine a human 
winning against those four heroes.

04:46.290 --> 04:49.720
The hero of the demons, 
Dark Empress Vanessa.

04:50.700 --> 04:54.640
The hero of the celestials, 
Heavenly Lord Alfreya.

04:55.470 --> 05:00.010
The hero of the spirits, 
Spirit Sovereign Rikugen Kyoko.

05:02.600 --> 05:06.750
The hero of the mythical beasts, 
Fang King Rath=IE.

05:08.030 --> 05:10.830
Just imagining them being around today...

05:11.190 --> 05:14.290
Prophet Sid defeated those four heroes...

05:15.310 --> 05:20.000
Using the shining sword that was given to him 
by the Prophetic God, Arsla Solaka.

05:20.580 --> 05:24.480
It's uncertain whether Prophet Sid 
and the shining sword even existed.

05:25.100 --> 05:29.690
There aren't any videos or photos of him, 
unlike the heroes of the four races.

05:29.690 --> 05:34.120
Well, it doesn't hurt to wish 
for someone like that to exist, right?

05:38.260 --> 05:39.580
Ow...

05:39.580 --> 05:43.040
Come on, Ashran. 
How long are you going to lie around?

05:44.140 --> 05:47.770
What do you guys want to do 
for Jeanne's promotion celebration?

05:47.900 --> 05:51.320
Huh? Wouldn't a bouquet of flowers 
or something be good enough?

05:52.530 --> 05:53.540
You know,

05:54.250 --> 05:56.360
Jeanne is getting transferred 
to the headquarters

05:56.360 --> 05:57.620
of the royal capital of Urzak, right?

05:58.250 --> 06:01.750
She's 17 years old, the youngest person
 in history to be selected.

06:01.750 --> 06:04.380
She's an elite among elites!

06:04.670 --> 06:07.840
I'm sure she's already 
going to be receiving bouquets.

06:08.120 --> 06:12.080
You sure you want our present 
to be as ordinary as that?

06:14.490 --> 06:15.720
It's from Jeanne?

06:17.430 --> 06:21.540
"Tomorrow morning at 10:00 AM, meet me at the 
9th terminal in front of the kitten statue"?

06:21.540 --> 06:25.360
"And keep it a secret 
from Saki and Ashran," what the...

06:25.360 --> 06:26.630
You've got it wrong.

06:27.330 --> 06:28.320
This isn't from Jeanne.

06:28.820 --> 06:32.830
Kai, don't tell me you're in 
a naughty relationship with Jeanne.

06:33.180 --> 06:37.330
Was it such a special text that you 
had to make up that lousy lie about it?

06:38.130 --> 06:39.590
I'm going to go for a run.

06:40.040 --> 06:42.080
Hey, wait up, ya bastard!

06:42.080 --> 06:43.700
Someone stop Kai!

06:43.700 --> 06:46.000
He's thinking of doing 
naughty things to Jeanne!

06:46.000 --> 06:47.100
It's not like that!

06:54.450 --> 06:57.190
Kai, thanks for waiting.

07:01.610 --> 07:03.920
You're not usually on time like that.

07:03.920 --> 07:06.160
I thought I'd have to wait another hour.

07:06.900 --> 07:08.150
How rude!

07:11.080 --> 07:15.990
I'm transferring to Urzak next week, 
so this is the least I could do, right?

07:16.760 --> 07:17.700
Besides...

07:18.380 --> 07:20.100
you're off duty today, aren't you?

07:20.100 --> 07:22.910
Why are you wearing such flashy clothes?

07:24.010 --> 07:27.170
I did my morning self training 
and came straight here.

07:27.490 --> 07:32.380
You're probably the only one who's unfazed 
by the idea of going shopping with me.

07:32.380 --> 07:34.160
Did you want to go shopping with someone else?

07:34.170 --> 07:35.390
Of course not!

07:35.390 --> 07:36.820
I'm being sarcastic!

07:37.870 --> 07:41.140
Well, that's what I like about you, Kai.

07:47.310 --> 07:49.330
By the way, what's our purpose 
in shopping today?

07:49.330 --> 07:51.700
I wanted to get presents for Saki and Ashran.

07:51.980 --> 07:52.590
Huh?

07:53.130 --> 07:57.530
You three are planning 
on getting me a present, right?

07:57.530 --> 07:58.950
You're going to ask <i>me</i> that?

07:59.260 --> 08:02.700
I want to give you guys 
 presents too, before I go to Urzak.

08:03.160 --> 08:05.950
It'll be the last time I'll see those two.

08:05.950 --> 08:08.300
Last time? Aren't you exaggerating it a bit?

08:08.750 --> 08:10.940
The transfer is at most two years, isn't it?

08:10.940 --> 08:14.000
You'll be back in no time as a cadet.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.390
By then, both Saki and Ashran

08:15.390 --> 08:18.350
will have finished their 
military service and be civilians.

08:21.010 --> 08:23.060
We'll likely be the only ones

08:23.060 --> 08:26.220
who'll still be soldiers in the Humanity
Aegis Agency two years from now.

08:27.540 --> 08:28.950
Yeah, probably.

08:32.390 --> 08:33.780
Don't look like that.

08:34.250 --> 08:37.290
You're going to surpass your father, 
the Urza Headquarters Chief, aren't you?

08:37.980 --> 08:41.680
You've said it to me dozens of 
times since we were kids...

08:41.680 --> 08:43.150
Your goal.

08:43.850 --> 08:45.330
Your numbers are off.

08:46.470 --> 08:48.510
It's a hundred dozen times, isn't it?

09:05.490 --> 09:07.630
Thanks for coming with me.

09:07.630 --> 09:09.740
You really helped me make
 some good purchases.

09:09.740 --> 09:11.150
I'm glad to hear that.

09:15.220 --> 09:17.760
You were ten years old, weren't you,

09:17.760 --> 09:20.930
when you wandered 
into the demon graveyard?

09:20.930 --> 09:25.660
Yeah. It was when your father 
took me along to go inspect it.

09:25.980 --> 09:27.610
I was so surprised.

09:27.610 --> 09:31.160
As soon as you came home, you were 
telling us how you saw Sid's sword.

09:33.140 --> 09:34.170
Yeah...

09:55.670 --> 09:57.820
Though I don't bring it up since 
no one would believe me.

09:58.200 --> 10:00.210
But wasn't it then

10:00.210 --> 10:01.940
that you started to say that it's your "duty"

10:01.940 --> 10:05.040
to make sure that the demons 
don't emerge from the graveyard?

10:05.570 --> 10:07.000
I still feel that way.

10:07.310 --> 10:08.600
Yeah.

10:08.600 --> 10:12.460
That's why you'll still be in the Humanity
Aegis Agency in two years.

10:14.720 --> 10:18.490
Hey, Kai. Where do you think 
we'll be in the future?

10:18.490 --> 10:22.430
In the future? 
Well, you're coming back in two years, right?

10:22.430 --> 10:25.310
No. I mean even after that.

10:27.320 --> 10:28.230
Kai...

10:29.770 --> 10:30.650
If I...

10:32.150 --> 10:33.150
Huh?

10:33.740 --> 10:34.670
Huh?

10:35.070 --> 10:35.780
Jeanne!

10:37.530 --> 10:38.240
Jeanne!

10:38.910 --> 10:40.450
What are you going on about?

10:40.900 --> 10:44.700
<i>Am I... the only one who sees this happening?</i>

10:45.060 --> 10:49.460
Um, you know if you call my name 
in front of all these people...

10:49.990 --> 10:52.980
Does that mean I can get 
my hopes up for various things?

10:55.930 --> 10:56.990
Jeanne!

11:00.710 --> 11:02.650
World reincarnation activated.

11:02.650 --> 11:05.130
Executing the overwriting of the world.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.380
Where am I?

11:16.070 --> 11:18.360
What is happening...

11:19.070 --> 11:21.950
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

11:22.070 --> 11:24.950
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

11:34.720 --> 11:35.420
Is someone there?!

11:47.530 --> 11:48.680
A demon?

11:49.260 --> 11:50.590
A human.

11:55.620 --> 11:57.190
Is that magic?!

11:57.190 --> 11:58.620
Disappear!

12:11.770 --> 12:14.150
<i>A real demon?</i>

12:31.290 --> 12:33.810
He canceled my magic?

12:34.350 --> 12:36.210
A modified elven bullet.

12:36.210 --> 12:39.400
It's a bullet created using 
elven magic as its base.

12:45.910 --> 12:47.330
Burn!

13:19.640 --> 13:23.570
That was the modified drake bullet that 
reproduces mythical beast breath.

13:23.570 --> 13:25.030
It's my first time actually using one, but...

13:27.620 --> 13:29.420
I was able to move just like in training.

13:29.770 --> 13:31.990
My equipment, and myself...

13:32.450 --> 13:34.770
I can fight against demons!

13:34.770 --> 13:36.880
What are you?

13:39.430 --> 13:40.900
A human?

13:40.900 --> 13:45.420
Are you saying that a human 
has defeated a demon?

13:45.880 --> 13:48.680
You sure are good at speaking 
the human language.

13:50.780 --> 13:55.930
The most effective way to give orders 
to a slave is by using its own language.

13:56.250 --> 13:57.890
Did you say... slave?

13:58.130 --> 14:02.010
Human, you smell dangerous.

14:02.010 --> 14:03.220
Disappear!

14:05.860 --> 14:06.820
Close your eyes!

14:13.410 --> 14:14.200
Move out!

14:17.890 --> 14:18.920
Wanderer secured.

14:19.280 --> 14:20.760
We're heading back now.

14:22.630 --> 14:25.420
What parts are you from?

14:25.690 --> 14:26.800
Saki?!

14:26.800 --> 14:28.850
How do you know my name?

14:28.850 --> 14:30.250
What are you talking about?

14:30.800 --> 14:32.330
It's me, Kai.

14:32.330 --> 14:33.180
Kai?

14:35.700 --> 14:39.230
Hey, have you heard
the name Kai before?

14:39.640 --> 14:41.020
Ashran!

14:41.020 --> 14:42.170
You're Ashran, aren't you?!

14:42.170 --> 14:45.690
Y-Yeah? Sorry, have we met?

14:46.650 --> 14:48.440
Hey, are you all right?

14:48.900 --> 14:52.270
He's still rattled from 
the demon attack, I'm sure.

14:55.360 --> 14:58.080
You guys don't remember me?

15:00.730 --> 15:05.000
We were in the same unit 
in the Humanity Aegis Agency.

15:05.000 --> 15:07.000
Humanity Aegis Agency?

15:07.240 --> 15:09.850
We're soldiers of the resistance.

15:09.850 --> 15:10.840
Resistance?

15:11.220 --> 15:13.680
You don't even know that?

15:13.680 --> 15:15.530
What in the world is...?

15:15.530 --> 15:20.360
There's no way you don't know about 
the resistance, the Human Rebel Army.

15:21.180 --> 15:22.400
I'm sorry.

15:22.720 --> 15:25.770
I really don't know what's going on.

15:26.380 --> 15:29.910
Could you tell me 
what's going on in this world?

15:33.180 --> 15:38.290
There was a war called the Great War 
of the Five Races, and humanity lost.

15:38.620 --> 15:41.000
Humanity... lost?

15:41.580 --> 15:44.090
That was over 30 years ago.

15:44.090 --> 15:49.210
Cities around the world were taken over 
by the other four races.

15:50.310 --> 15:52.970
So... what happened to the humans?

15:53.380 --> 15:54.490
Are they okay?

15:54.490 --> 15:57.480
We're running and hiding. Barely.

16:00.180 --> 16:01.390
Is this Vashal?

16:01.650 --> 16:04.260
Hey, you remember place names, at least.

16:05.590 --> 16:06.500
Yeah.

16:11.300 --> 16:14.040
Right now, the other four races 
are ruling the world

16:14.040 --> 16:16.160
while fighting each other over territory.

16:16.690 --> 16:19.340
The Urza Federation 
was taken over by the demons,

16:19.340 --> 16:22.160
so all we could do was 
abandon the cities and run.

16:26.250 --> 16:27.420
Welcome...

16:28.910 --> 16:31.800
to the human city, Neo Vashal.

16:34.870 --> 16:35.890
I want that!

16:37.510 --> 16:39.850
We took the underground space 
that was still intact

16:39.850 --> 16:41.600
and remodeled it into an underground city.

16:41.600 --> 16:43.380
It's a pretty good one, isn't it?

16:43.850 --> 16:45.730
And so we protect the people

16:46.030 --> 16:48.930
and continue to fight back 
against the four races.

16:48.930 --> 16:51.050
That's who we are; the resistance.

16:53.060 --> 16:53.650
What's up?

16:54.540 --> 16:59.620
Um, why did humanity lose 
the Great War of the Five Races?

17:00.050 --> 17:01.320
Why?

17:01.320 --> 17:03.740
You saw those demons, didn't you?

17:03.740 --> 17:06.350
Those things attack us in groups.

17:06.350 --> 17:08.560
Humans couldn't possibly beat them.

17:08.560 --> 17:13.540
Right. Plus the races each have a
head boss, whom they refer to as a hero.

17:13.540 --> 17:15.180
They're extraordinarily strong individuals.

17:15.570 --> 17:17.890
But what about Prophet Sid?

17:18.370 --> 17:20.140
Prophet Sid?

17:20.140 --> 17:21.100
Who's that?

17:22.940 --> 17:25.270
You really don't know him?

17:25.870 --> 17:29.520
There's supposed to be a human hero 
who defeated the four races.

17:29.780 --> 17:33.740
If we had someone like that 
we wouldn't be living underground like this.

17:36.130 --> 17:39.010
Oh, the main corps have arrived.

17:39.010 --> 17:39.700
Main corps?

17:39.700 --> 17:40.520
Jeanne-sama!

17:40.520 --> 17:43.880
You see, there are several other 
human cities out there.

17:43.880 --> 17:48.670
There's a resistance garrison in each one, 
overseen by the main corps.

17:48.920 --> 17:53.380
The commander of the resistance is a savior 
to the people of the Urza Federation.

17:53.380 --> 17:54.840
It's the commander!

17:54.840 --> 17:55.940
They're back!

17:55.940 --> 17:57.070
Jeanne-sama!

17:57.070 --> 17:58.800
Jeanne-sama!

17:58.800 --> 18:00.560
Welcome home!

17:59.470 --> 18:02.470
Isn't he the handsomest? Jeanne-sama...

18:03.160 --> 18:04.520
Jeanne!

18:08.520 --> 18:11.050
We have been waiting for you, Jeanne-sama.

18:11.050 --> 18:13.520
No abnormalities in the Vishal district.

18:13.520 --> 18:16.170
We will continue to do 
our best to ensure security.

18:16.170 --> 18:17.510
Good work.

18:17.510 --> 18:19.610
I appreciate your dedication.

18:20.100 --> 18:22.580
Who is this? I haven't seen him before.

18:22.930 --> 18:24.660
We secured him on the surface.

18:24.660 --> 18:26.290
He goes by the name Kai,

18:26.290 --> 18:29.090
but it seems his memories are a bit confused.

18:29.090 --> 18:32.920
He doesn't seem to be a bad guy, so there's 
nothing for you to worry about, Jeanne-sama.

18:33.180 --> 18:34.630
I see. Goodbye, then.

18:44.930 --> 18:46.520
Wait, Jeanne!

18:46.850 --> 18:48.270
It's me, Kai!

18:48.750 --> 18:51.340
You were shopping with me a few moments ago!

18:51.340 --> 18:55.440
You said you wanted to give presents to 
Saki and Ashran before you headed to Urzak!

18:57.490 --> 18:59.420
What are you talking about?

18:59.420 --> 19:01.350
It seems you've mistaken me for someone else.

19:04.860 --> 19:07.620
You really don't remember?

19:08.100 --> 19:09.060
I'm sorry.

19:09.060 --> 19:11.830
I have a meeting to attend, 
so if you'll excuse me...

19:13.560 --> 19:15.540
Why are you dressed like that?

19:16.510 --> 19:18.680
Why are you pretending to be a guy?!

19:19.640 --> 19:24.010
You said you wanted to surpass 
your father as a daughter!

19:24.010 --> 19:25.190
And yet...

19:26.500 --> 19:28.420
What do you think you're doing?

19:29.370 --> 19:31.550
That's enough, Falin. Let him go.

19:34.610 --> 19:36.930
Hey, Kai! What are you doing?!

19:36.930 --> 19:39.640
What's with him? So rude!

19:37.560 --> 19:40.780
Just rest today, all right? 
I'll let you use my room.

19:54.490 --> 19:56.080
What is going on?

19:57.210 --> 19:59.630
<i>No matter how many times 
I look through the documents,</i>

19:59.630 --> 20:03.680
<i>the only records missing 
are of me and Prophet Sid.</i>

20:04.740 --> 20:07.560
Is this a world where Sid never existed,

20:07.560 --> 20:10.800
and humanity lost 
the Great War of the Five Races?

20:13.010 --> 20:15.840
Wait. If Sid doesn't exist,

20:16.360 --> 20:18.480
and humanity lost in the Great War 
of the Five Races, then...

20:20.750 --> 20:25.800
why do graveyards 
to seal away the four races exist?!

20:28.330 --> 20:29.670
Graveyards?

20:29.670 --> 20:31.940
Never heard of them.

20:31.940 --> 20:33.710
Okay, thanks.

20:34.510 --> 20:37.150
Ashran, can I borrow the car?

20:37.150 --> 20:39.170
I'll be back by midday.

20:39.350 --> 20:40.280
Sure.

20:41.010 --> 20:41.900
Here.

20:41.900 --> 20:42.750
Thanks.

20:43.150 --> 20:45.550
Hey, Ashran!

20:44.780 --> 20:46.550
Hm? Huh?

20:46.970 --> 20:49.400
I just reflexively...

20:56.940 --> 20:59.530
<i>The demons keep careful watch 
over the urban areas.</i>

21:11.420 --> 21:13.780
This is my first time coming here alone.

21:19.050 --> 21:21.250
The blockade stone was removed?

21:25.470 --> 21:29.220
It's leading to the inside. 
Then just ahead should be...

21:36.740 --> 21:37.900
That's...

21:45.910 --> 21:47.580
Sid's sword.

21:52.010 --> 21:56.420
I knew it. The legends of Sid were true.

22:08.350 --> 22:11.260
You who have been enveloped 
in the hatred of fate,

22:12.260 --> 22:14.240
do not relinquish this sword—

22:14.910 --> 22:18.810
the world coordinate key; the Code Holder.

22:18.810 --> 22:20.270
The Code Holder?

22:28.230 --> 22:30.120
Someone...

22:31.290 --> 22:32.560
Please...

22:33.110 --> 22:34.630
Save...

22:40.930 --> 22:42.590
I'm not in the graveyard?

22:46.130 --> 22:47.180
Is that...

23:11.930 --> 23:13.160
A girl?

23:14.710 --> 23:15.720
An angel?

23:17.170 --> 23:18.120
A demon?

23:21.250 --> 23:22.170
Who's there?

23:25.190 --> 23:26.430
Please...

23:29.010 --> 23:33.350
free me from these chains.

23:35.010 --> 23:39.930
<b>Episode 1
"The Boy Forgotten by the World"</b>
